-of/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Charles Milton v. Raymond K. Procunier, Director, Texas...\">744 F. 2d 1091</a></span>; No. 84-6251, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9547617\"><a href=\"/opinion/1173391/nuckols-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Nuckols v. State\">690 P. 2d 463</a></span>; No. 84-6285, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"2022910\"><a href=\"/opinion/2022910/averhart-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Averhart v. State\">470 N. E. 2d 666</a></span>; No. 84-6348, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1129519\"><a href=\"/opinion/1129519/copeland-v-state/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Copeland v. State\">457 So. 2d 1012</a></span>; No. 84-6442, <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"1841667\"><a href=\"/opinion/1841667/ex-parte-weeks/\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Ex Parte Weeks\">456 So. 2d 404</a></span>.</p>\n</opinion>"},{"id":9047164,"type":"035concurrenceinpart","typeCode":"035concurrenceinpart","perCuriam":false,"author":"Brennanmarshall","joinedBy":"","pageCount":null,"textLength":631,"isHtml":true,"text":"<opinion type=\"concurring-in-part-and-dissenting-in-part\">\n<author id=\"b964-15\">Justice Brennan and Justice Marshall,</author>\n<p id=\"A3rH\">dissenting.</p>\n<p id=\"b964-16\">Adhering to our views that the death penalty is in all circumstances cruel and unusual punishment prohibited by the Eighth and Fourteenth Amendments, <em>Gregg </em>v. <em>Georgia, </em><span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"9426555\"><a href=\"/opinion/109532/gregg-v-georgia/#227\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Gregg v. Georgia\">428 U. S. 153, 227, 231</a></span> (1976), we would grant certiorari and vacate the death sentences in these cases.</p>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}